# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationReBootstrap. A resize swaps in a new
# physical tree with the same content. If the receiver compares its aligned
# generation with the physical tree, every reconcile after a resize skips for ever.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceAlignedComparesPhysicalTree
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the aligned generation includes the physical tree, so after a resize the reconcile never runs
PERTURBS: EndExport

--- FIND
           okSrc == orphan /\ stable /\ ex.gen0 = aligned
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the aligned comparison also requires the original physical tree.
           okSrc == orphan /\ stable /\ ex.gen0 = aligned /\ ex.phys0 = 0
--- END
